msgstr "Nepoznat sadržaj"

msgid ""
"Something's wrong with your database installation. Make sure the appropriate "
"database tables have been created, and make sure the database is readable by "
"the appropriate user."
msgstr ""
"Nešto nije uredu sa vašom bazom podataka. Provjerite da li postoje "
"odgovarajuće tabele i da li odgovarajući korisnik ima pristup bazi."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You are authenticated as %(username)s, but are not authorized to access this "
"page. Would you like to login to a different account?"
msgstr ""
"Autentifikovani ste kao %(username)s, ali nemate ovlaštenje da pristupite "
"ovoj stranici. Da li biste željeli da se prijavite na drugi nalog?"

msgid "Forgotten your password or username?"
msgstr "Zaboravili ste svoju lozinku ili korisničko ime?"

msgid "Date/time"
msgstr "Datum/vrijeme"

msgid "User"
msgstr "Korisnik"

msgid "Action"
msgstr "Radnja"

msgid ""
"This object doesn't have a change history. It probably wasn't added via this "
"admin site."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj objekat nema zabilježen historijat izmjena. Vjerovatno nije dodan kroz "
"ovaj sajt za administraciju."

msgid "Show all"
msgstr "Prikaži sve"

